# One offline picker journey. No tool, scanner, source or provider execution.
name: Capability preparation guidance across modal and plain readers
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
wait-for: 25 Start Map
submit: modules
wait-for: 15 CAPABILITIES
keys: Down
wait-live-snap: 15 MODEL REQUIRED | missing-model
expect: model selects a model
ask: Does the selected threat-map action disclose its missing model and a usable recovery step without presenting preparation as permission to run?
keys: Down
wait-live-snap: 15 INPUT REQUIRED | missing-input
expect: options recon:import
resize: 160x48
wait-live-snap: 15 options recon:import | inputs-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait-live-snap: 15 options recon:import | inputs-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait-live-snap: 15 options recon:import | inputs-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait-live-snap: 15 options recon:import | inputs-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait-live-snap: 15 recon:import | inputs-40x12
expect: INPUT REQUIRED
expect: options recon:import
expect: Import recon
expect: Enter load
expect: ↑/↓ action
ask: At 40x12, can the operator identify the selected action, read the full recovery command and retain the picker controls?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
wait-live-snap: 15 no work started | loaded-input-draft
expect: recon:import
expect-not: RUN FOCUS
expect: Editing a command
expect-not: Enter loads a draft
ask: Does Enter load an editable command while preserving the fact that no tool work started?
keys: C-u
keys: C-c
wait-for: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT
keys: y
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -c 'import pathlib,sys; p=pathlib.Path(sys.argv[1])/".kuzushi/v3/config.toml"; p.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True); p.write_text("model = \"other:fixture\"\n")' @TMP_HOME
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
wait-for: 25 Start Map
submit: modules
wait-for: 15 CAPABILITIES
keys: Down
wait-live-snap: 15 RUNTIME CONFIG | unsupported-runtime-no-color
expect: doctor
expect-not: RUN FOCUS
ask: Does no-color preparation disclose incompatible configuration and a diagnostic route without replacing the selected model or starting work?
keys: C-c
wait-for: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL
launch:
wait-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE A TARGET | target-gate
keys: Escape
wait-live-snap: 15 CAPABILITIES | targetless-capabilities
expect: TARGET REQUIRED
expect: Enter target picker
expect-not: Enter load
ask: Does targetless browsing name the target-picker action without substituting the current directory or advertising a draft load?
keys: Enter
wait-live-snap: 15 CHOOSE A TARGET | reopened-target-picker
expect-not: RUN FOCUS
ask: Does Enter reopen explicit target selection without starting work or choosing a repository?
keys: Escape
type: preserved targetless operator draft
keys: C-c
wait-for: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT
keys: y
require-exit: 10
